      "updated": 1792869510963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": null,
      "text": "Your understanding: ✅ basically right\nMediaPipe → stick figures → compare with stored\nexamples → score → closest example's word.\n\nTwo corrections:\n1. It compares the whole MOVEMENT (1–2 s of stick figures),\n   not one figure.\n2. It compares learned fingerprints, not raw stick figures.",
      "originalText": "Your understanding: ✅ basically right\nMediaPipe → stick figures → compare with stored\nexamples → score → closest example's word.\n\nTwo corrections:\n1. It compares the whole MOVEMENT (1–2 s of stick figures),\n   not one figure.\n2. It compares learned fingerprints, not raw stick figures.",
