      "updated": 1792869510963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": null,
      "text": "Why it's hard (you're right)\n• It only knows words it has examples for\n• Examples from strangers match poorly\n  (top guess right ~2 in 3, never confident)\n• Testing needs labelled clips per signer\n• Many signs are motion: one frame can lose\n  the meaning (e.g. tomorrow vs today)",
      "originalText": "Why it's hard (you're right)\n• It only knows words it has examples for\n• Examples from strangers match poorly\n  (top guess right ~2 in 3, never confident)\n• Testing needs labelled clips per signer\n• Many signs are motion: one frame can lose\n  the meaning (e.g. tomorrow vs today)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "u_hard",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
